      "side": 1,
      "message": "Updated to return just the blob, `CStr`, and uuid. since everything was validated in `ConfigHeader::new`, the panic paths should not be possible.\n\nThe blob isn\u0027t actually used as a slice though... would a `*const u8` and `usize` be better?",
